    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Tilted Tennis, a competitive paddle ball game where the camera moves and spins with the ball! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Disorient Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with or against your friends, spin the ball as you hit it towards their goal to try and catch them off guard and win the match. But if you want to defend your goal be prepared to get disoriented yourself keeping track of which way is up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Variety of Maps to Choose From</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have many styles of maps available for play, from air hockey to volleyball style, featuring different configurations for 1-4 players and beyond, including team based maps and solo practice maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/815c33b062c12456eb19fae203c31496.avif?t=1742178567\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Map Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you can't find what you're looking for, you can build your own map too! Our built-in map editor will let your make the custom map of your dreams. Not the creative type? That's okay! You can download maps from other users off of the Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.poster.avif?t=1742178567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.webm?t=1742178567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.mp4?t=1742178567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online and Local Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends locally! Play with your friends over the internet! Play with some friends locally, and others over the internet! Our flexible lobby system will allow you to play the way you want. Including LAN and UPnP lobbies for potential cross-platform play. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rollback Netcode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilizing rollback technology, in Tilted Tennis you'll get a near seamless online play experience. Neither you nor your friends will experience input latency while your connection is stable.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Tilted Tennis, a competitive paddle ball game where the camera moves and spins with the ball! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Disorient Your Friends</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with or against your friends, spin the ball as you hit it towards their goal to try and catch them off guard and win the match. But if you want to defend your goal be prepared to get disoriented yourself keeping track of which way is up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Variety of Maps to Choose From</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have many styles of maps available for play, from air hockey to volleyball style, featuring different configurations for 1-4 players and beyond, including team based maps and solo practice maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/815c33b062c12456eb19fae203c31496.avif?t=1742178567\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Custom Map Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you can't find what you're looking for, you can build your own map too! Our built-in map editor will let your make the custom map of your dreams. Not the creative type? That's okay! You can download maps from other users off of the Steam Workshop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.poster.avif?t=1742178567\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.webm?t=1742178567\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1986560/extras/eb1ff3e0045add2e9c8914757bb35bca.mp4?t=1742178567\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Online and Local Play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends locally! Play with your friends over the internet! Play with some friends locally, and others over the internet! Our flexible lobby system will allow you to play the way you want. Including LAN and UPnP lobbies for potential cross-platform play. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rollback Netcode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilizing rollback technology, in Tilted Tennis you'll get a near seamless online play experience. Neither you nor your friends will experience input latency while your connection is stable.</p>",
